  "description": "The OpenGL render backend for RobotSimulation: Silk.NET OpenGL device and context, mesh / material / texture upload, the built-in GLSL pipeline (model, line, point, skybox, axes) and the renderer. The only backend implementation; the host's own Silk.NET GL handle is what crosses the boundary (GraphicsFactory / GraphicsContext and the resource types uploaded through them), and every GL object below that line is owned here.",
